                            <div class="wysiwyg">
    
    <span id="MainContentArea_ContentModule5445_CMSContentLabel"><!-- WSC News Release | 2026 Holiday Toy Drive -->
<section class="wsc-toydrive-release" lang="en"><!-- Opening summary for Modern Campus news previews -->
<p class="wsc-td-intro">Williston State College and Teton Athletics are partnering with Les Schwab Tire Center for the 2026 Holiday Toy Drive, November 4 through December 18. Community members can donate new, packaged toys at The Well or Les Schwab to help brighten the holidays for local children.</p>

<div class="wsc-td-grid"><!-- Main Article -->
<article class="wsc-td-content">
<p><strong>Williston, ND &mdash;</strong> Williston State College and Teton Athletics are once again teaming up with Les Schwab Tire Center to help bring some extra holiday cheer to children in the community through the 2026 Holiday Toy Drive.</p>

<p>The drive, which runs November 4 through December 18, is collecting new, packaged toys. A donation box is located in The Well near the ticket booth, giving Teton fans an easy way to contribute while attending home athletic events throughout the next month.</p>

<h2>How to Donate</h2>

<p>Donations can also be made directly at Les Schwab Tire Center in Williston. Customers who donate a new, packaged toy at Les Schwab will receive a $25 coupon toward a future visit. The store is also accepting monetary donations for those who would like to support the drive without purchasing a toy.</p>

<blockquote class="wsc-td-quote">
<p>&ldquo;Partnering with Les Schwab on the toy drive is a great opportunity for Teton Athletics and Williston State College to give back during the holiday season,&rdquo; said Mason Przybilla, Athletic Director and Head Baseball Coach at Williston State College.</p>

<p>&ldquo;Our community does so much to support our student-athletes and the College throughout the year, and we&rsquo;re proud to give Teton fans an easy way to help make the holidays a little brighter for local children.&rdquo;</p>
</blockquote>

<h2>Supporting Local Children and Families</h2>

<p>Following the conclusion of the drive, collected toys and donations will be delivered to a local organization serving children and families in the community.</p>

<p>WSC and Teton Athletics encourage students, employees, Teton fans and area residents to join the effort by donating before December 18.</p>
<!-- Media Contact -->

<section aria-labelledby="td-media-heading" class="wsc-td-contact">
<h2 id="td-media-heading">Media Contact</h2>

<p><strong>Brittny Mayo</strong><br />
Director of Marketing and Communications<br />
Williston State College<br />
<a href="tel:+17017744223">701.774.4223 </a><br />
<a href="mailto:brittny.mayo@willistonstate.edu">brittny.mayo@willistonstate.edu </a></p>
</section>
</article>
<!-- Right Sidebar -->

<aside aria-labelledby="td-event-heading" class="wsc-td-sidebar">
<h2 id="td-event-heading">2026 Holiday Toy Drive</h2>

<p class="wsc-td-sidebar-lead">Help Make the Holidays Brighter!</p>

<dl class="wsc-td-details">
	<dt>Donation Dates</dt>
	<dd><time datetime="2026-11-04">November 4 </time> &ndash; <time datetime="2026-12-18"> December 18, 2026 </time></dd>
	<dt>What to Donate</dt>
	<dd>New, packaged toys</dd>
	<dt>WSC Drop-Off Location</dt>
	<dd>The Well<br />
	Near the ticket booth<br />
	Williston State College</dd>
	<dt>Additional Drop-Off Location</dt>
	<dd>Les Schwab Tire Center<br />
	Williston, North Dakota</dd>
	<dt>Monetary Donations</dt>
	<dd>Accepted at Les Schwab Tire Center</dd>
	<dt>Community Partners</dt>
	<dd>Williston State College<br />
	Teton Athletics<br />
	Les Schwab Tire Center</dd>
</dl>

<div class="wsc-td-divider">&nbsp;</div>

<h3>Donate at Les Schwab</h3>

<p>Customers who donate a new, packaged toy at Les Schwab will receive a <strong>$25 coupon</strong> toward a future visit.</p>

<div class="wsc-td-highlight"><strong>Donate by December 18</strong><br />
Give a toy. Spread some joy.<br />
Support local children.</div>

<p class="wsc-td-note">Toy donations may be dropped off at The Well during home athletic events or directly at Les Schwab Tire Center in Williston.</p>
</aside>
</div>
